Cell["\<\
The Catch function allows us to implement an \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]IF/ELSE\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] condition. It\[CloseCurlyQuote]s better than the \
standard \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]IF/ELSE\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] because it \
checks at every step and stops when it finds zero, whereas \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]IF/ELSE\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] checks all divisions \
first.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97877856687973*^9, 
  3.978778649115471*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"194f3599-b131-e048-b5e8-\
889e62f080e8"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

